<!--
    Settings labels: registry rows (android/settings-registry, DakSettings), app-declared Appearance rows
    (AppearanceSettings), premium feature summaries (premium-api Feature) and the Language row.

    Names are derived from stable keys (SettingsStringKeys / Feature.stringKey); do not rename them. The English
    text here must equal the registry's English literals: SettingsStringResourcesTest (settings-registry, runs
    without the Android SDK) and SettingsTextTest (app) fail otherwise. Translators: titles are short (a list row
    headline), summaries are one sentence under it, option labels appear in a radio list. See docs/i18n.md.
-->
